New Testament meaning of ordination, and (3) the meaning attached to ordination
by the state.&lt;/span>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>ORIENTATION TO ORDINATION</title><link>https://christir.org/essays/topics/christian-doctrine/church-ecclesiology/ordination/orientation-to-ordination/</link><pubDate>Mon, 16 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://christir.org/essays/topics/christian-doctrine/church-ecclesiology/ordination/orientation-to-ordination/</guid><description>&lt;style>
